WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:21.349
Tom hurried to the moat.

2
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.935
Dirk stood with some servants.

3
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:29.190
"What took you so long?" Dirk scowled.

4
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:34.447
"Princess Mary is waiting for you!"

5
00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:38.106
"Princess Mary?" Tom looked over.

6
00:00:38.107 --> 00:00:41.766
A beautiful young woman stood near the water.

7
00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:51.533
She held a handkerchief as she sobbed.

8
00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:56.308
Tom hurried over to the beautiful princess.

9
00:00:56.309 --> 00:00:59.784
"What's wrong?" Tom asked.

10
00:00:59.785 --> 00:01:04.485
"My royal crown!" said Princess Mary.

11
00:01:04.486 --> 00:01:08.216
"It fell in the moat!"

12
00:01:08.217 --> 00:01:12.627
"Now, now, Princess," Dirk said.

13
00:01:12.628 --> 00:01:16.619
He flashed an evil smile at Tom.

14
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:22.887
"The royal wizard will get it out at once.

15
00:01:22.888 --> 00:01:26.766
Isn't that right, Tom?"

16
00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:30.395
"That's right," Tom mumbled.

17
00:01:30.396 --> 00:01:34.422
He stepped closer to the moat.

18
00:01:34.423 --> 00:01:42.405
The water looked dark and murky.

19
00:01:42.406 --> 00:01:45.241
Then Tom spotted something.

20
00:01:45.242 --> 00:01:48.683
"I see the royal crown!" he called.

21
00:01:48.684 --> 00:01:54.862
The others peered into the water.

22
00:01:54.863 --> 00:01:59.068
"All I need is a net," Tom said.

23
00:01:59.069 --> 00:02:03.280
He waved his wand. Poof!

24
00:02:03.281 --> 00:02:10.978
"Ack!" cried Dirk.

25
00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:13.280
"Oops," said Tom.

26
00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:17.075
Everyone was wearing hairnets now!

27
00:02:17.076 --> 00:02:21.249
Princess Mary giggled a little.

28
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.582
But Dirk was angry.

29
00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:27.307
He ripped off his hairnet.

30
00:02:27.308 --> 00:02:32.900
"You idiot, Tom!"

31
00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:38.829
"I'm sorry, Princess," Tom said.

32
00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:47.155
"Just get the crown!" Dirk yelled. "Now!"

33
00:02:47.156 --> 00:02:50.404
Suddenly—splash!

34
00:02:50.405 --> 00:02:53.586
A sound came from the moat.

35
00:02:53.587 --> 00:03:00.712
Tom looked in the water and gasped.

36
00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:04.060
"Are those—?"

37
00:03:04.061 --> 00:03:10.897
"Yes!" Dirk grinned. "They're crocodiles.

38
00:03:10.898 --> 00:03:21.786
Hungry, hungry crocodiles!"
